  "description_html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"courseDescription\">\n    Prerequisite: JPN 1013 or equivalent.\n\nContinued training in basic Japanese communication (speaking and writing) and comprehension (listening and reading) skills to increase proficiency in the language within a variety of cultural contexts.\n\nThree hours of applied class work and one hour of foreign language lab per week is required. \n\nNote: Advanced placement and credit by examination are available to students who have previously studied Japanese.\n\n    \n</section>",
